Welcome to SteamPhone!
=====================

This device is running SteamOS on ARM hardware.

Hardware: Samsung Galaxy S20 FE 5G (SM-G781N)
SoC: Qualcomm Snapdragon 865
GPU: Adreno 650

Quick Commands:
  steamphone-status   - Show system status
  steamphone-config   - Open configuration
  steamphone-power    - Power menu

Report issues: https://github.com/jihwanahn/steamphone
